Alembic Database Migrations for broll-organizer
===============================================

This directory contains Alembic database migrations for the broll-organizer project.

## Usage

### Run migrations on a drive

```bash
broll migrate /path/to/external/drive
```

### Check migration status

```bash
broll migrate /path/to/external/drive --show-status
```

### Manual Alembic commands

For advanced usage, you can run Alembic commands directly:

```bash
# Upgrade to latest
uv run alembic -x drive_path=/path/to/drive upgrade head

# Show current revision
uv run alembic -x drive_path=/path/to/drive current

# Show history
uv run alembic history --verbose
```

## How It Works

- Migrations are stored in `alembic/versions/`
- The database URL is dynamically constructed from the drive path via `-x drive_path=...`
- sqlite-vec extension is automatically loaded for vector table operations
- All schema changes are captured in versioned migration files

## Auto-Migration on Init

When you run `broll init /path/to/drive`, migrations are automatically applied
to ensure the database schema is up-to-date.

## Schema

The current schema includes:
- `videos` - Main video catalog table
- `videos_fts` - FTS5 virtual table for full-text search
- `videos_vec` - sqlite-vec virtual table for semantic search
- `location_cache` - Geocoding cache for location names
